      "resolution": "Requirement removed. Honest partial-effects model reports ISSUED only for actually fired actions and UNKNOWN/zero timing otherwise. Mode12 accepts exact issued/reserved/unadopted command receipt, retains all genuine reader pins, refuses key/CONTROL/STOP, then observes separate actual adoption at original tick before granting keys and exact retirement.",
      "source": "src/core/mixed_scheduled_readers.c:322",
